label story_alt_lost_complete (A Path Forsaken Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Five more days. Five more dawns pulled from a path we thought the dark had swallowed whole.
"Dianthus Core": The old chain is broken. The road I dreamed of leading you down no longer exists. But your hands did not stop tending life — and that is its own kind of road.
"Dianthus Core": This is not the true bloom I hoped for. It is still a garden. It still stands. And it stands because of you, little alchemist. That is enough. That has to be enough.
